# Couette flow to compute viscosity of H2

### Initialization ###
seed                12345
dimension           3
units               si

### Problem definition ###
boundary            s p p
create_box          -0.0005 0.0005 -0.0005 0.0005 -0.0005 0.0005
create_grid         10 10 10
species             h2.species H2
global              fnum 7.07043E6
mixture             gas H2 vstream 0.0 0.0 0.0 temp 300
create_particles    gas n 20000 twopass

### Settings ###
collide             vss gas h2.vss
surf_collide        1 diffuse 300 0 translate 0.0 100.0 0.0
surf_collide        2 diffuse 300 0 translate 0.0 -100.0 0.0
bound_modify        xlo collide 1
bound_modify        xhi collide 2

### Output ###
# Bulk viscosity
# momxy is the off-diagonal component of the momentum flux density tensor (shear stress)
compute         momflux pflux/grid all gas momxy
fix             ave_momflux ave/grid all 100 10 1000 c_momflux
variable        viscosity equal -f_ave_momflux/(200/0.001)
# Wall viscosity

### Actions ###
timestep           1.0e-8
stats              1000
stats_style        step cpu np nattempt ncoll c_momflux v_viscosity
run                10000

# Print final values
#print "Bulk viscosity: ${tau_bulk}"
#print "Wall viscosity: ${tau_wall}"
